diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 941eda8..4f0b876 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -242,3 +242,50 @@ commit. The checkout response exposes `ownerNotificationSent` separately from
 `emailSent`; both are null on a replay. SMTP failures do not roll back orders.
 Delivery failures are logged; automatic email retries are not configured.
 Deploy/restart the checkout API to enable this notification in production.
+
+
+Studio Haze public order tracking: `POST /api/storefront/studio-haze/orders/track`
+with JSON `{ "orderNumber": "SH-38B9A1FF6F2B" }`. Lookup is restricted to the
+configured Studio Haze channel/owner and returns only order, payment and
+fulfillment states, plus an assigned J&T waybill/URL and estimated delivery date.
+Pickup orders never return courier details. No customer address, contact details,
+receipt images or internal notes are exposed. Responses are not cached.
+
+Studio Haze shipping now includes Smokey and Raspberry Blue at 10 g with the
+standard 6 × 4 × 1.5 inch parcel, matching their configured storefront dimensions.
+The local-only `node scripts/studio-haze-preview.cjs` serves public storefront
+endpoints on loopback port 43828 using the existing `.env`, without scheduled jobs.
+It uses the configured database; submitted checkouts are real orders. Deploy the
+updated shipping controller, tracking controller and routes to fix production.
+
+
+### Storefront product synchronization
+
+`GET /storefront/studio-haze/products` exposes published sales-channel products.
+The Store Price is authoritative; descriptions and images use website display
+fields. Authenticated owners manage listings with `GET /sales-channel/products`
+and `PUT /sales-channel/products/:libraryId`; stock adjustments use
+`POST /sales-channel/products/:libraryId/stock`. Costing records are unchanged.
+Checkout resolves product IDs/names against the channel's current published
+listings and writes product identifiers to order-line snapshots.
+
+`node scripts/sync-studio-haze-products.cjs` previews matching existing costed
+products. `--apply` imports the five original website listings, descriptions,
+images, and prices without changing stock or costing. The import was applied
+for Studio Haze; Topaz is PHP 550. Deploy `storage/storefront-products` with the
+new controllers/helpers/routes. Existing product/media tables are used; no new
+migration is needed. The local preview API serves the imported images as well.
+
+
+### Durable private receipt images
+
+Apply `20261116_sales_channel_receipt_storage.mysql.sql` before deploying this
+update. New order receipt bytes are saved in `sales_channel_payment_proof_files`
+inside the checkout transaction. Authenticated receipt requests prefer this
+private database copy and retain the business-owner access check. Legacy local
+files are copied into the same table when read. Run
+`node scripts/backfill-receipt-storage.cjs` on the server to preserve any existing
+Studio Haze receipt files before a deployment removes its local files. Two
+recoverable local receipts have already been backed up; missing originals need
+recovery from the original uploads or a hosting backup. Receipt bytes must never
+be committed to Git or placed under a public static URL.
